"role.tanukiPortableMegaphone.name" : "Megaphone"
"role.tanukiPortableMegaphone.short" : "AMP"
"role.tanukiPortableMegaphone.blurb" : "Let your voice reach further!"
"role.tanukiPortableMegaphone.doc" : "A Crewmate with a toggleable voice amplifier. While ON, adds a configurable distance to BCL's ordinary voice range (default +5). Starts at 100% battery, with 60 seconds of use by default. Drains even while silent. Empty batteries cannot activate. Each completed task restores 10% by default, capped at 100%. The host can configure range, full-battery duration and recharge. Meetings and death turn it OFF; meetings keep the remaining charge. <br>Disable ability during communications sabotage is OFF by default. When ON, sabotage turns the amplifier OFF without draining or resetting its battery. Reactivate manually after repair.<br>Requires compatible BCL."
"options.role.tanukiPortableMegaphone.detail" : "Spend battery to amplify your voice; complete tasks to recharge."
"options.role.tanukiPortableMegaphone.extraRange" : "Extra voice range"
"options.role.tanukiPortableMegaphone.capacity" : "Full battery use duration"
"options.role.tanukiPortableMegaphone.recharge" : "Battery restored per task"
"options.role.tanukiPortableMegaphone.disableInComms" : "Disable ability during communications sabotage"
"button.label.tanukiPortableMegaphone.on" : "Megaphone"
"button.label.tanukiPortableMegaphone.off" : "Active"
"button.label.tanukiPortableMegaphone.empty" : "Empty"
"button.label.tanukiPortableMegaphone.comms" : "Comms down"
